<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 16.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 16.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Friday, May 16:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,511.40 (1,510.90)	CHF  1,059.40 (1,044.50)</p>
<p>    DEM    894.53 (885.02)	  GBP  2,481.60 (2,472.70)</p>
<p>    ATS    127.06 (125.78)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Thursday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $16.39 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$13.67 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $30.06 million ($43.72 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
